# Act One
= She finds the letter.

INT. KITCHEN - NIGHT #1#
= Maya finds the letter in the coat.
[[arc: MAYA]]

MAYA stands at the counter. A **coat** drips on the chair.
[[Hold on the coat.]]

MAYA
You kept it.

JON ^
I kept the pocket.

She doesn't look at him.

CUT TO:

EXT. STREET - NIGHT #2#

Rain.

MAYA (V.O.)
The pocket was the whole point.
